      <slug></slug>
      <title>Smuxi - IRC in a modern environment</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Mono</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Smuxi is an advanced IRC client that solves the &amp;#34;always available&amp;#34; problem in a graphical environment, providing a graphical alternative to the popular text-based ssh + irssi + screen combination.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In this talk, I will present the current functionality of Smuxi and discuss plans for the future.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="1921">Mirco Bauer</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>